flowchart TB
    A[SQL file draft] --> B[Run in practice DB]
    B --> C{Error?}
    C -->|No| D[Verify results]
    D --> E[Reviewed SQL]

    C -->|Yes| F[Copy error message]
    F --> G[Ask Codex to fix]
    G --> H[Codex modifies SQL]
    H --> I[Human review]
    I --> B

    G --> G1[Keep requirements]
    G --> G2[Explain reason in comments]
    G --> G3[Do not change unrelated logic]
